# Encounter overrides for the Jekk'Jekk Tarr tunnels and Visquis's
# stronghold (our own data, see crates/session/src/encounters.rs; never
# written into the game install).
#
# Here the player plays Mira alone. Players found Hanharr and the Ubese
# bounty hunters too tough for her blasters (playtest feedback, 2026-11).
# Hanharr's Wookiee Toughness takes 2 points off every hit. That is about
# 40% of a KOTOR II blaster pistol's average roll of 4.5. Here he has 75%
# of his template's 52 hit points, which is 39.
hp hanharr x0.75
# The Ubese bounty hunters have 80% of their template's 9 hit points,
# which rounds to 7, before KOTOR II's enemy scaling multiplies them.
hp genodisc x0.8
hp ubh305alarm1 x0.8
hp ubh305alarm2 x0.8
